    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Description:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed perspective integral mini-game, easy to operate. Take care to control the frequency of hitting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How it works:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard: Space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspension: ESC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle Full Screen/Window: F11</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearance Conditions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Reach 499 points</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game End Conditions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. When the red 5 points are reduced to 0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Close the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS: Don't touch the only correct goal, happy game!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Description:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed perspective integral mini-game, easy to operate. Take care to control the frequency of hitting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How it works:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard: Space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspension: ESC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle Full Screen/Window: F11</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearance Conditions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Reach 499 points</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game End Conditions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. When the red 5 points are reduced to 0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Close the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS: Don't touch the only correct goal, happy game!</p>",
    "short_description": "3D fixed perspective, unique level, just press the spacebar to push the wrong robot into the ruins to get points. Note: There were only 5 chances of turnover.",
